{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudslistitemcontentstyle"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@frozen","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSListItemContentStyle","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The style controls the border, divider, and background appearance of list items."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Use the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/SwiftUICore\/View\/oudsListContentStyle(_:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/SwiftUICore\/View\/oudsListItemStyle(divider:background:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/SwiftUICore\/View\/oudsListCardStyle(_:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" view modifiers to apply the style on list items."}]},{"text":"Cases","anchor":"Cases","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"code":".card(_:)","type":"codeVoice"}]},{"type":"text","text":": A card-like appearance with various sub-styles (decoration) defined by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSListItemContentStyle\/card(_:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". Cards can be outlined, have a background,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or combine these effects only on interaction."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"code":".item(_:)","type":"codeVoice"}]},{"type":"text","text":": A standard list item appearance with an optional background and divider,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"defined by "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSListItemContentStyle\/item(divider:background:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}]},{"text":"Known limitation","anchor":"Known-limitation","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onlyOnInteraction"},{"type":"text","text":" flag of the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"outlined"},{"type":"text","text":" decoration of a card has no action on "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSStaticListItem","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", because"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the item does not propose interaction (e.g. pressed or hover state)"}]},{"text":"Code samples","anchor":"Code-samples","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"codeListing","code":["    \/\/ Card style with outline only on interaction","    OUDSNavigationListItem(data: OUDSListItemData(label: .textual(\"Label\")))","        .oudsListCardStyle(decoration: .outlined(onInteractionOnly: true))","","    \/\/ Card style with an outlined border on all states","    OUDSNavigationListItem(data: OUDSListItemData(label: .textual(\"Label\")))","        .oudsListCardStyle(decoration: .outlined(onInteractionOnly: false))","","    \/\/ Card style with divider, background","    OUDSNavigationListItem(data: OUDSListItemData(label: .textual(\"Label\")))","        .oudsListCardStyle(decoration: .standard(divider: true, background: true))","","    \/\/ Card style divider and without backgro